                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: 'times new roman', times, serif;">Epidemiology is a core methodological course for clinical medicine students. This course systematically introduces the basic theories and practical methods of epidemiology. The main contents include fundamentals of epidemiology, disease distribution and commonly used epidemiological indicators, causal inference, descriptive study, case-control study, cohort study, clinical trial, evaluation of diagnostic and screening test, as well as the epidemiology and prevention and control measures of infectious diseases. Focusing on clinical application, this course emphasizes the principles and technical specifications of disease surveillance, causal exploration, clinical research design, and evaluation of diagnosis and intervention effects. It aims to cultivate students’ ability to analyze epidemic patterns, identify disease risk factors, and objectively evaluate clinical diagnostic and therapeutic measures. This course provides a systematic methodological foundation for clinical practice, evidence-based medical decision-making and clinical scientific research.</span></p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
